 src/kernels/winograd_bwd_data.cl   | 68 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/kernels/winograd_bwd_filter.cl | 69 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 src/kernels/winograd_fwd.cl        | 70 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++---
 4 files changed, 215 insertions(+), 24 deletions(-)

