+    // DLPRIM_CONV_FP16=1: the three Winograd kernels keep their LDS tiles and
+    // run their register-tile GEMM in fp16 (packed v_pk_fma_f16, twice the
+    // fp32 rate on RDNA), with fp16 accumulation over one work-group's K
+    // slice. Tensors in global memory stay fp32. Measured on an AMD gfx1013:
